title: crossfeed
message: "If you use crossfeed, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Syntropa"
  - name: "KU Leuven, Laboratory of Molecular Bacteriology"
abstract: >-
  crossfeed builds experimentally grounded microbial interaction networks from mGrowthDB co-growth data,
  in a neutral, openly citable format that downstream tools such as Syntropa and microbetag can consume.
