url: "https://github.com/crossfeed-bio/crossfeed"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-09-14"
keywords:
  - microbial interactions
  - cross-feeding
  - mGrowthDB
  - metabolic modeling
  - open science
